# Session artifacts (agent-generated scratch files, NOT deliberate docs).
#
# AGENTS.md is deliberately NOT ignored: it is this project's steering document
# (working rules for humans and agents) and belongs in version control.  The
# old blanket `*AGENT*.md` pattern silently excluded it, so it existed only as
# an untracked local file and `git add -A` skipped it without comment.
*_AGENT_*.md
AGENT_NOTES*.md
*TASK_*.md
*SESSION*.md
*STATUS_*.md
*WORK_COMPLETE*.md
*INTEGRATION_WORK*.md
*COMPILATION_FIXES*.md
*SANITIZER_REPORT*.txt

# Scripts for one-time migrations
apply_*.sh
apply_*.py

# Generated helper scripts
gen_compile_commands.*
check_tcache.c

# Quarantined/unintegrated sources.  umem_htm.[ch] and umem_percpu.[ch] now
# live in attic/ (tracked, not built -- see attic/README.md); these entries
# only keep a stray top-level copy from being re-added by accident.
# umem_numa.[ch] is NOT ignored: it is a tracked, built source under
# --enable-numa.
depot_functions_lockfree.c
/umem_htm.c
/umem_htm.h
/umem_percpu.c
/umem_percpu.h

